### 1. Tambah menu baru (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Nasi Goreng Spesial",
  "deskripsi": "Nasi goreng dengan telur dan ayam suwir",
  "harga": 18000,
  "kategori": "Makanan Utama",
  "isTersedia": true
}

### 2. Ambil semua menu (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/menu

### 3. Ambil satu menu berdasarkan ID 
GET http://localhost:3000/menu/918d03fb-e1f3-40e2-aa7d-60008b4a60fa

### 4. Update menu berdasarkan ID
PATCH http://localhost:3000/menu/918d03fb-e1f3-40e2-aa7d-60008b4a60fa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "harga": 20000,
  "isTersedia": false
}

### 5. Hapus menu berdasarkan ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/menu/918d03fb-e1f3-40e2-aa7d-60008b4a60fa